{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/lib/ui/inbox/inbox_split.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-19T18:43:02.598982Z","id":"52fc5d979d33f18b51242876b868d4f1c4940793e845ec0dd058be79674569b9","body":{"detail":"The phone's Mark all read is disabled while nothing shown is unread; the list pane does not tell InboxSplit when that changes.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":143},"end":{"line":143},"content_hash":"3e251e758154330b0a6a10868af2c970063a7fa2d6d275578e4f1bf4e162e696"},"suggested_fix":"Have InboxScreen report whether any shown item is unread, and declare the item enabled by it.","summary":"The Inbox window's Mark all read toolbar item is always enabled, also when nothing in the view is unread (the click then does nothing)","tags":["macos","inbox","session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/lib/ui/inbox/inbox_split.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-19T23:00:14.106860Z","id":"4f42996d74bb8c09e97a5d55f2342b15c7cc26cde876ab866e052266b3fded5d","body":{"detail":"The phone's Mark all read is disabled while nothing shown is unread; the list pane does not tell InboxSplit when that changes.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":169},"end":{"line":169},"content_hash":"3e251e758154330b0a6a10868af2c970063a7fa2d6d275578e4f1bf4e162e696"},"suggested_fix":"Have InboxScreen report whether any shown item is unread, and declare the item enabled by it.","summary":"The Inbox window's Mark all read toolbar item is always enabled, also when nothing in the view is unread (the click then does nothing)","supersedes":"52fc5d979d33f18b51242876b868d4f1c4940793e845ec0dd058be79674569b9","tags":["macos","inbox","session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/lib/ui/inbox/inbox_split.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-22T05:43:06.868498Z","id":"b366eef8fbf759c0bec41b3fc85fc782cb5cd5f6aff8639c37937a3170c7415b","body":{"detail":"Only AppScreen hides composers for comments off (AppScreen.linkedHead, apps/clax_app/lib/ui/app_screen.dart:316). InboxSplit builds ThreadDetail without replies:, so a reply from the Inbox on such an app's thread is posted locally and refused by the remote. ThreadDetail.replies (apps/clax_app/lib/ui/thread_detail.dart:262-267) is the seam; the wiring that passes linkedHead to AppScreen needs to reach the Inbox too.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":238},"end":{"line":252},"content_hash":"4082c6a64d30adc97532b4021114e79f296c0abbd26113b6e13973568d28d281"},"summary":"The Inbox's thread page keeps its reply bar on a linked app whose public copy takes no comments","tags":["review","deferred-wiring","spec:2026-10-21-app-push-pull#5.11","session:claude-code:b2fb951f-3ceb-4c65-a7b7-a705e815488a"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/lib/ui/inbox/inbox_split.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-22T09:15:17.496393Z","id":"43c42ff41efe900305254d3cf4819761cb5e2017733e715cc156cf3c836913b3","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:5cce3fefa","summary":"InboxSplit.linked (LinkedChecker.status, passed by apps/clax_app/lib/app.dart to both Inbox splits) sets ThreadDetail.replies from the head's comments. bazelisk test //apps/clax_app:ui_inbox_split_test PASSED at 5cce3fefa; 'a thread of an app whose public copy takes no comments has no reply bar…' fails with replies forced on (target/t10-mut-inbox.log).","supersedes":"b366eef8fbf759c0bec41b3fc85fc782cb5cd5f6aff8639c37937a3170c7415b","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:b2fb951f-3ceb-4c65-a7b7-a705e815488a"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/lib/ui/inbox/inbox_split.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-22T11:03:08.558308Z","id":"bd7add4a803f141ad0e7ca9f8f7090f195bd35651af8e164e152ddf84035cd7c","body":{"detail":"InboxSplit builds ThreadDetail with replies only; it passes no heldReply, heldNote or publishAndReply, so only the app screen's thread page (apps/clax_app/lib/ui/app_screen.dart, from LinkedAppHooks) shows that Claude's reply waits and offers Publish vN and reply. On the Mac's Inbox window and the phone's Inbox, a person reading the thread sees nothing of it. The resolve that closed c491cae3 names this gap as record 22b07d37, which no .qual file holds.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":246},"end":{"line":266},"content_hash":"d921dceba957e82e4286c3544be4e70a1cf6d7012a73973cac8521742a8f7e98"},"suggested_fix":"Pass LinkedAppHooks (or its heldReply, heldNote and publishAndReply) into InboxSplit and on to ThreadDetail, as app_screen.dart does.","summary":"The Inbox's thread page has no held card: a reply waiting for its version to be public is neither shown nor offered as Publish vN and reply there","tags":["area:remote","spec:2026-10-21-app-push-pull#5.11","review","session:claude-code:b2fb951f-3ceb-4c65-a7b7-a705e815488a"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/lib/ui/inbox/inbox_split.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-22T11:15:03.063916Z","id":"31e211e9544872773a25ca8ec822aa4f2069c9c56fdfb105fd73003132dd4b83","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:90a831819","summary":"InboxSplit.linkedApps takes the app's LinkedAppHooks (apps/clax_app/lib/app.dart passes _linkedHooks to both Inbox splits), and the Inbox thread page passes heldReply, heldNote and publishAndReply to ThreadDetail as AppScreen does. test/ui/inbox_split_test.dart 'a thread whose reply waits shows the held card, why its version is not public, and Publish vN and reply' passes at 90a831819 and fails with the page's heldReply left null (Found 0 widgets with text 'Claude’s reply waits for v2 to be public.'). just test-affected 0efee33d8 at 90a831819: 191 tests pass (target/t10d.log). The resolve of c491cae3 (4c64441ed) named this gap as record 22b07d37; the record is this one.","supersedes":"bd7add4a803f141ad0e7ca9f8f7090f195bd35651af8e164e152ddf84035cd7c","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:b2fb951f-3ceb-4c65-a7b7-a705e815488a"]}}
